// FIRSTWARD_COV_AMBUSHING_COW_ACTIVE :
"P4205194483" "Who is this? More lambs for the slaughter?"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_AMBUSHING_COW_ACTIVE :
"P1161683132" "Hahahaha! More subjects for our wrath!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_AMBUSHING_COW_ACTIVE :
"P4186718709" "These creatures are yours? Do you claim them?"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_AMBUSHING_COW_ACTIVE :
"P1923711039" "AI-yi-yi-yi! Vengeance claims its due!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_AMBUSHING_COW_ACTIVE :
"P1925856971" "More? There is plenty of death to go around!"

// FIRSTWARD_COV_AMBUSHING_DST_ACTIVE :
"P2576813513" "Ahhhh, subjects worthy of my wrath!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_AMBUSHING_DST_ACTIVE :
"P4226255726" "Surprise suckers! Prepare for death!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_AMBUSHING_DST_ACTIVE :
"P2613153835" "I have longed to end you. I will enjoy this."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_AMBUSHING_DST_ACTIVE :
"P1178835436" "If only I could kill you again and again."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_AMBUSHING_DST_ACTIVE :
"P2714226002" "I cast you down into the darkness you deserve!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_AMBUSHING_DST_ACTIVE :
"P2870075206" "This world begs for your death. I am its instrument."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_AMBUSHING_DST_ACTIVE :
"P393050867" "Give Cole my regards. I'll carve it into your forehead."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_AMBUSHING_DST_ACTIVE :
"P297146413" "Let me add your corpse to the pile."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_AMBUSHING_DST_ACTIVE :
"P3754721956" "I was created to destroy you!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_AMBUSHING_DST_ACTIVE :
"P1230530400" "I exist to end you!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_AMBUSHING_DST_ACTIVE :
"P1237517587" "A greater power commands me to destroy you!"


// FIRSTWARD_COV_CONVOCATION_CASTER_INACTIVE :
"P3897874567" "You are an instrument of Fate, bringing the Judgement of the Universe upon oathbreakers, despoilers, and false prophets.<em>Take up your Fang so that you may worry the necks of the wicked and spill their blood for vengeance sake."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CONVOCATION_CASTER_INACTIVE :
"P2022317426" "When the Tyrant slew Stefan Richter at our holy Well, he wrote his name upon the Execrable List, consigning himself and all he has made to destruction at our hands.<em>So the Erinyes command. So you shall obey."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CONVOCATION_CASTER_INACTIVE :
"P1999371804" "And when the time of Judgement is upon you, do not hesitate.<em>Be deaf to their pleas.<em>Be blind to their enticements.<em>Be cold to their sympathies.<em>You have no mercy, only righteous vengeance."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CONVOCATION_CASTER_INACTIVE :
"P2334079387" "And when the scum beg for mercy, dig the knife in just a little deeper.<em>Every attempt to elicit your sympathy is just another display of their weakness.<em>Look them in the eyes when you cut the life from them.<em>Let them know, without any doubt, that to them you are not human.<em>You are death... their death... and there is no escape."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CONVOCATION_CASTER_INACTIVE :
"P1672056068" "You are Tisiphone, avenging the murdered.<em>You are Magaera, the grudge that only grows with time.<em>You are Alecto, without forgiveness or mercy.<em>Rise, Talon of Vengeance, and drive your claw deep into the heart of the Tyrant."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CONVOCATION_CASTER_INACTIVE :
"P2257206168" "Cast aside your humanity, for only without it can you truly embrace the spirit of vengeance.<em>Your humanity will cause you to hesitate when swift action is required.<em>Humanity can only bring you grief when the killing time has come.<em>Leave it behind you Sister, and take up your Talon."




// FIRSTWARD_COV_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P3109642844" "You have chosen the wrong side!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P2252409082" "You thought a belief in war would take you far, we went farther."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P1457108508" "There is still time, join us."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P4048156398" "Do you not see? Vengeance for the oathbreaker is the only answer."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P431426569" "You have been misled, the Carnival of Light has gone soft!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P2853546706" "I do not want to kill you, but I will if you force me."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P2783403839" "Deluded fool, look where your loyalty has led you."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P4102138363" "Don't you just want to see it all burn?"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P2018145066" "Admit it, you know what we say is true."


// FIRSTWARD_COV_BATTLE_COL_INACTIVE :
"P2265237524" "Weak fools, you deserve the death I bring."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_BATTLE_COL_INACTIVE :
"P1795423107" "Worthy subjects for our wrath!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_BATTLE_COL_INACTIVE :
"P4098799879" "Your belief in the light has blinded you to the truth!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_BATTLE_COL_INACTIVE :
"P2210990605" "You and your kind are irrelevant. A new power has arisen."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_BATTLE_COL_INACTIVE :
"P3860982322" "Your devotion to the weak and unworthy has spelled your downfall. The Talons of Vengeance are the true inheritors of divine power!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_BATTLE_COL_INACTIVE :
"P2530972325" "I shall waste no more words with you. DIE!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_BATTLE_COL_INACTIVE :
"P102674998" "Turn away from your pointless quest, join us in the cause of Vengeance. It is the only way."



// FIRSTWARD_COV_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2181536475" "The Carnival is weakening. Support in the Last Word is wearing thin."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4248479920" "The time to strike is now, while the Carnival is distracted elsewhere."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3060506464" "A new enemy has entered the field."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3195326508" "Do others in the Last Word believe in the cause of Vengeance?"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4033451729" "Soon the DUST will no longer matter. Their reign will be short lived."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P126591051" "Our efforts in Mercyview Cemetery are hindered by their spirit wards."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1393081123" "The apparitions are becoming more aggressive with each passing day, soon they will be too difficult to control."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P778049189" "The Carnival is aware of us, but they are pre-occupied with other threats. Our time to strike will be arriving soon."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P439330636" "Do not doubt that our cause is just. When we are established in First Ward, we will expand into Praetoria proper. Our ultimate goal is the destruction of Cole and all he has created."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P849321086" "We believe our information drops have been compromised. This isn't the first time one of our operations have run right into a Carnival ambush."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2131214225" "The time is not yet right to take the fight to Tyrant. If we had half their numbers, we'd have the Emperor's head on a pike by now."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3334147847" "When Marcus Cole betrayed Richter at the Well, he cast his fate before the Furies to be judged.<em>We are the instruments of that judgement and his crimes shall be writ upon the sky in the smoke of his ruined ambitions. So have the Furies commanded."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4169041059" "It is time for Marcus Cole to suffer and burn, to have his body and mind rent by the talons of righteous vengeance.<em>The victims cry out for justice, and we shall give it to them."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1427818318" "Gird yourselves for the struggle to come, my sisters, for vengeance is a bloody work, but just, and we shall not shrink from it.<em>Not an inch...not an iota."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P996851700" "Our influence among the Carnival of Light grows. As each turns to the cause of war, that much closer they are to embracing the cause of vengeance."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3592391317" "They deserve to die, all of them, for fostering this bloated lie, this so-called Emperor Cole.<em>They are all complicit in his tyranny through their blind obedience. Praetoria needs to burn."




// FIRSTWARD_COV_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P127562365" "Continue surveillance of the Last Word and the Chapel of Enduring Light. While the Carnival is pre-occupied with the apparitions and the awakened, they will make mistakes that we can exploit."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P685971192" "Seed the Carnival with our missives. The more of them we can turn from the light, the greater will be the cause of vengeance."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P1929886634" "The Talons direct us to subvert as many to the cause of vengeance as we can. The pawns of Eltentown are ripe for conversion; their anger at their condition is fertile ground for hatred."


// FIRSTWARD_COV_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE :
"P3349441951" "Strike above the neck and at all extremities."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE :
"P4144555348" "Do not comfort the oathbreaker before you kill it."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE :
"P2108270620" "Ignore their pleas for mercy, for the oathbreaker's every breath is a lie."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE :
"P3859676406" "Turn their desire to protect the innocent into a desire to strike at the enemy. Turn their desire to strike at the enemy into a lust to unmake all they know and love. Then they are a true servant of Vengeance."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE :
"P3808916829" "When you question your desire for vengeance you weaken all of us. Strike such thoughts from your mind as you would dig a tick from your flesh: by hot iron or knife blade, bleed yourself of compassion."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE :
"P3083314090" "The Talons have given us a great gift, they have shown us the true way."


// FIRSTWARD_COV_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_INACTIVE :
"P860854266" "There's nowhere for you to go. It is time to face your destiny!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_INACTIVE :
"P1562869495" "You will not escape us! This is your final warning!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_INACTIVE :
"P819915147" "You can either surrender to us now or you can die. The choice is yours!"





// FIRSTWARD_COV_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2221138385" "They must not know my part in this!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1827559994" "I'm out of here!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3357888902" "No! They've found us!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3954781390" "Cover my retreat!"





// FIRSTWARD_COV_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P1854686920" "Abomination! We will destroy you!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P1415812310" "Your power is nothing compared to that which we wield, creature!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P3682424116" "Your mind is already gone, corrupted! Soon your body will follow!"

// FIRSTWARD_COV_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_ALERTED :
"P4146724783" "These abominations can wait! Eliminate the challenger!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_ALERTED :
"P1831689827" "There is no shortage of slaughter today! Destroy them all!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_ALERTED :
"P1340073061" "Quickly! Strike now and we can defeat them all before they can strike!"

// FIRSTWARD_COV_MEDIC_INACTIVE :
"P359096745" "Once they are healed, we must see to it that they choose to serve us."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_MEDIC_INACTIVE :
"P3400817091" "The strength of my healing is not what it once was."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_MEDIC_INACTIVE :
"P166355768" "Our allegiance with the Talons has weakened my ability to heal. I may not be able to aid them."

// FIRSTWARD_COV_MEDIC_ALERTED :
"P2026967308" "This one is ours now! You will not interfere!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_MEDIC_ALERTED :
"P206577400" "You shall be made to serve us, just as this one will!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_MEDIC_ALERTED :
"P2187530681" "You should not have come here. Now you will be forced to serve!"

// FIRSTWARD_COV_ELTENGUARD_INACTIVE :
"P1135481064" "We will protect them, and they will join us. Our numbers will grow stronger!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_ELTENGUARD_INACTIVE :
"P1499730881" "Do not lose sight of our goals. We are to convince those who live here that allegiance to the Talons is the only way to survive the coming battles."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_ELTENGUARD_INACTIVE :
"P835082009" "Those who are willing to join must be protected. Those unwilling to serve must be eliminated."


// FIRSTWARD_COV_PROTECT_AGAINST_DST_INACTIVE :
"P2010572076" "Guard these against Cole's army. They will make valuable agents of vengeance!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_PROTECT_AGAINST_DST_INACTIVE :
"P2744962721" "You will not slaughter these folk this day! They are claimed by vengeance!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_PROTECT_AGAINST_DST_INACTIVE :
"P2162105725" "Turn away, DUST dogs. These people belong to us now!"

// FIRSTWARD_COV_PROTECT_AGAINST_DST_ALERTED :
"P3869098178" "You interfere with our vengeance! We shall claim you then, as well!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_PROTECT_AGAINST_DST_ALERTED :
"P1328542248" "Another sacrifice has come to us, seeking to assist in the atonement of Cole's sins! Destroy them all!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_PROTECT_AGAINST_DST_ALERTED :
"P3856863389" "Death to all of you! Your blood shall serve the cause of vengeance well!"

// FIRSTWARD_COV_CAPTURE_DST_READSCROLL_INACTIVE :
"P511242180" "Servants of Cole... pathetic. Your armor means nothing against the might of vengeance!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CAPTURE_DST_READSCROLL_INACTIVE :
"P1508804055" "Your ilk have lost this place, and yet you still fight? Well, then, welcome to your end!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CAPTURE_DST_READSCROLL_INACTIVE :
"P380266617" "We shall see to it that your Emperor will pay for his crimes. As his servant, you shall pay as well!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CAPTURE_DST_READSCROLL_INACTIVE :
"P579229445" "There is nothing left for you now except death!"


// FIRSTWARD_COV_CAPTURE_RES_READSCROLL_INACTIVE :
"P2040966911" "Resistance? Resistance! You dregs are nothing! It is we who shall be the end of Cole."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CAPTURE_RES_READSCROLL_INACTIVE :
"P267363950" "Pathetic. This is what Vanessa thought could aid in Cole's overthrow? Look at how it squirms!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CAPTURE_RES_READSCROLL_INACTIVE :
"P3240509549" "Weaklings. We shall see that your ilk are eliminated so that it cannot interfere with our mission!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CAPTURE_RES_READSCROLL_INACTIVE :
"P1899885500" "The Resistance is a lost cause, for you lack the strength of vengeance. You will serve... or you will die!"


// FIRSTWARD_COV_CAPTURE_COW_READSCROLL_INACTIVE :
"P1085059653" "Foolish brethren! Did you truly believe that you could stand against the onslaught?"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CAPTURE_COW_READSCROLL_INACTIVE :
"P2799688399" "Warmongering fool. Now you see that there is no stopping the tide of vengeance."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CAPTURE_COW_READSCROLL_INACTIVE :
"P2165454234" "Your death will serve the cause of our mistresses among the Talons as well as any other's would."
// FIRSTWARD_COV_CAPTURE_COW_READSCROLL_INACTIVE :
"P2858307243" "How dare you call us traitors! It is you who betrayed Praetoria by fighting against us! We seek to save it!"


// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_DST_INACTIVE :
"P516637920" "You are a fool if you think you have won!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_DST_INACTIVE :
"P2900334611" "So long as I still draw breath, it is your death that is assured!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_DST_INACTIVE :
"P763677629" "Pitiful. Is that the best you can muster?"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_DST_INACTIVE :
"P2854649872" "It is you who should prepare for death, cretin!"

// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_DST_ALERTED :
"P2212203504" "You dare interfere with my inevitable victory? You too shall die!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_DST_ALERTED :
"P3396648000" "Another wishes to throw themselves upon the pyre? I shall gladly oblige!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_DST_ALERTED :
"P2955431386" "Another? Very well. Vengeance will claim you all!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_DST_ALERTED :
"P2480625816" "Your death is now as inevitable as it is for these fools."



// FIRSTWARD_COV_AMBUSHING_FE_ACTIVE :
