// FIRSTWARD_COV_SANCTUARY_ALERTED :
"P1805971919" "Death to all who stand in our way!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_SANCTUARY_ALERTED :
"P4243679135" "You dare to interfere with the execution of vengeance? Such a crime must be punished!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_SANCTUARY_ALERTED :
