// FIRSTWARD_COV_BATTLE_RES_INACTIVE :
"P85604229" "I have long wished for a chance to crush you, Resistance. Prepare to die!"

// FIRSTWARD_COV_BATTLE_RES_ALERTED :
"P3413224845" "You would dare interfere with our impending victory? I shall have my revenge!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_BATTLE_RES_ALERTED :
