"P2918980375" "Blood and vengeance!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_RES_ALERTED :
"P427106757" "Your death approaches!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_RES_ALERTED :
"P3819285063" "There is no hope for survival against the onslaught of Vengeance!"

// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_FE_INACTIVE :
"P439087401" "Wretched creatures. You do not even realize you will soon be dead!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_FE_INACTIVE :
"P2971779746" "Feast upon me? You will be lucky to live through my wrath!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_FE_INACTIVE :
"P896119009" "My vengeance will destroy you, creature!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_FE_INACTIVE :
"P522646525" "Pathetic wretch... you shall not lay claim to any victory over my vengeance!"

// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_FE_ALERTED :
"P1526763804" "Ah, a better challenger seeks to sacrifice themselves to vengeance!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_FE_ALERTED :
"P1991365514" "Another lamb awaits slaughter! Come, lamb, and meet your death!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_FE_ALERTED :
"P906817994" "Vile cur. How dare you interfere with my vengeance!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_FE_ALERTED :
"P2697084878" "You will all bleed... you will all suffer... you will all die!"

// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_APP_INACTIVE :
"P4043711214" "Pitiful spirit, do you believe your hatred can surmount my wrath?"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_APP_INACTIVE :
"P3468778364" "Your hatred will not be enough to defeat me!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_APP_INACTIVE :
"P131015108" "You shall not claim any victory over me, spirit!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_APP_INACTIVE :
"P3254507528" "I shall delight in bringing you the death you so richly deserve!"

// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_APP_ALERTED :
"P175122237" "You wish to interfere? I shall see you slaughtered as well!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_APP_ALERTED :
"P3762242079" "Death comes for all, by the hand of vengeance!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_APP_ALERTED :
"P1606777993" "Another comes to fall before my wrath?"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_APP_ALERTED :
"P1928681652" "You seek death. I shall gladly oblige!"

// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P1639436812" "It is you who are the abomination, and it is you who will die!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P2832385071" "You have no hope of defeating me!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P1081965499" "Abomination! I will see you destroyed!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P2097601595" "Pathetic. Do you truly believe you can contain my wrath?"

// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_AWK_ALERTED :
"P2620001871" "Ah, I see another wishes to sacrifice themselves!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_AWK_ALERTED :
"P1207231545" "Another joins the fray. I shall see you dead!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_AWK_ALERTED :
"P2911482765" "You shall be made to pay the price for your involvement!"
// FIRSTWARD_COV_LASTSTAND_AWK_ALERTED :
"P3993067659" "Death comes swiftly to you now!"

